# slides/ IS committed in this repo, unlike in the Augmented Designer monorepo:
# the deck lives in that other (private) repo, so without the captures checked in
# here you could never re-render the booklet after a copy edit. raw/ is the
# full-size PNG capture that slides/ is downscaled from — that one stays out.
raw/

# Build output — regenerated by build.mjs, and it points at the ignored slides/
# anyway, so it is unusable on its own. The PDF is the artefact worth keeping.
day-1-booklet.html

# Scratch from the preview/contact-sheet scripts
thumbs/
sheet.html
node_modules
